e=\"37\"><img alt=\"37\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-306601.png/100px-HeadIconSmall-306601.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-306601.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/37\" title=\"37\">37</a></span></span></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">实装版本：</span>3.7</div></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:3em\">来源：</span>点唱机</div></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">所属系列：</span>岁月的书签</div></div><div><div class=\"grey-small test-hide hide-m\">编号ID：306605</div></div></div></div><div class=\"skin-video tabber\"><h2><span id=\".E8.A7.86.E9.A2.91.E9.A2.84.E8.A7.88\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"视频预览\">视频预览</span></h2><div class=\"tabber-filter\" style=\"margin:0 -3px 4px -3px\"><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button selected\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"5\">1技能</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"4\">2技能</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"3\">大招</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"2\">追击</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"1\">入场</div></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"5\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3066/306605/37-小技能1.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3066/306605/37-小技能1 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"4\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3066/306605/37-小技能2.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3066/306605/37-小技能2 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\" style=\"display:none\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"3\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3066/306605/37-大招.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3066/306605/37-大招 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\" style=\"display:none\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"2\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3066/306605/37-追击.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3066/306605/37-追击 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\" style=\"display:none\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"1\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3066/306605/37-入场.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3066/306605/37-入场 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\" style=\"display:none\"></div></div><h2><span id=\".E7.AA.97.E4.B8.AD.E4.BE.A7.E5.86.99_Garment_Display\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"窗中侧写_Garment_Display\">窗中侧写<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">Garment Display</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"infopad\">酸甜交织，口感柔软，为舌头带来一丝冰凉——她从梦境中跃出，逃离禁锢着自身的小罐子，徜徉在这片冰冻与甜蜜的海洋中。<br />“奶油使其柔滑，糖分可以控制冰点，而恰当的比例则可以使流体的结构稳定。”<br />“充分的搅拌使甜蜜以另一种更蓬松的形态重生——我们得以在凝固的冰淇淋中塑造出完美的结构。”<br />“通过奶油、果仁、蛋筒与手摇式搅冻机，我们完成了一道精彩的证明——这是完美的流体！”<br />这是一个奇特的日子，它是世界上唯一以食品命名的国际性节日。在这样一个被祝福的日子里，连冰淇淋的证明也变得格外顺利——衷心祝愿，每一个孩子都能得到一杯牛奶。</div><div id=\"崭新单品\"></div><h2><span id=\".E5.B4.AD.E6.96.B0.E5.8D.95.E5.93.81_All-new_Item\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"崭新单品_All-new_Item\">崭新单品<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">All-new Item</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"char-item-box0 tabber\"><div class=\"char-item-box1 tabber-item\" data-skinid=\"306605\"><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-306610.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/3/37/Belonging-306610.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">“牛奶函数”<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">\"Function of Cream\"</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"雨滴\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/Value-1.png/27px-Value-1.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"雨滴\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/bb/Value-1.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />1<hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>洁白的围裙，缀以流苏，用以接住意外飞溅的液滴。<br />受访者称，裙摆边缘表现了融化的奶油在重力作用下流淌的规律。计算这条函数曲线花费了20个冰淇淋，不过其中80%是用作了受访者“思考的燃料”。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-306611.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/4/4b/Belonging-306611.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">厨房用手套<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Kitchen Gloves</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"利齿子儿\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Value-2.png/27px-Value-2.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"利齿子儿\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/6/62/Value-2.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />80<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到60%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>一双厨房专用手套，为小数学家提供涉足新领域的仪式感，以及必要的卫生条件。<br />手套内侧印刷了“甜蜜美味”神秘术式，其触发条件是特定比例的牛奶和砂糖。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-306612.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/3/3e/Belonging-306612.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">彩针糖<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Sprinkles</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"利齿子儿\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Value-2.png/27px-Value-2.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"利齿子儿\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/6/62/Value-2.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />0.3<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到100%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>甜点上常见的装饰品，由可可脂、白砂糖制成，色彩缤纷如虹。<br />请注意，尽管受访者身上也落有彩针，但这并不意味着她由冰淇淋或蛋糕组成。</div></div></div></div></div><h2><span id=\".E8.A1.A3.E7.9D.80.E6.B5.B7.E6.8A.A5\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"衣着海报\">衣着海报</span></h2><div style=\"display:flex; gap:10px; border:1px solid #b55829; width:fit-content\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%AE%8C%E7%BE%8E%E7%9A%84%E6%B5%81%E4%BD%931.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"衣着 完美的流体1.jpg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1a/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%AE%8C%E7%BE%8E%E7%9A%84%E6%B5%81%E4%BD%931.jpg/228px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%AE%8C%E7%BE%8E%E7%9A%84%E6%B5%81%E4%BD%931.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"228\" height=\"325\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1a/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%AE%8C%E7%BE%8E%E7%9A%84%E6%B5%81%E4%BD%931.jpg/342px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%AE%8C%E7%BE%8E%E7%9A%84%E6%B5%81%E4%BD%931.jpg 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1a/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%AE%8C%E7%BE%8E%E7%9A%84%E6%B5%81%E4%BD%931.jpg/456px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%AE%8C%E7%BE%8E%E7%9A%84%E6%B5%81%E4%BD%931.jpg 2x\" data-fil